Tirakoobka dib u eegista bogagga ee meel kasta oo magac ah ayaa hoos lagu muujiyay, ''iyadoo laga reebay'' bogagga leexinta.
Bogagga waxaa loo tixgeliyaa ''{{int:validationstatistics-old}}'' haddii ay leeyihiin tafatirro sugaya dib-u-eegis;
bogagga waxaa loo tigeliyaa ''{{int:validationstatistics-latest}}'' haddii aysan jirin tafatirro sugaya dib u eegis.
